# Data (raw exports, working files, not committed)
data/raw/
data/staging/
data/*.csv
data/*.xlsx.bak

# ...except the source of truth. episodes.csv is the episode list itself, and
# the reason it is a CSV rather than the xlsx it replaced is so that git can
# show which episode changed. It has to be tracked for that to mean anything.
!data/episodes.csv

# The same goes for the upcoming-films list, converted from
# "remaining films.xlsx" by convert_xlsx_to_csv.py --source upcoming. It is a
# source of truth in exactly the same sense: a hand-curated list whose changes
# need to be reviewable as a diff.
!data/upcoming.csv

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Temporary
*.tmp
tmp/
temp/
